  "licensedScope": [
    "All original fixed mixed QueryMember tests and lookup endpoints at any fixed n are locally constant almost everywhere, including structurally constant equality pieces.",
    "Positive continuous majorants and the original continuous actualPrimeBoxTestSum Mertens limit give a discrete bound for the changed screen on true ordered prime tuples with p_i not dividing N.",
    "On a shared original ordered word the ideal and frozen sides retain their own real Q and exact residual. The repeated-prime singular series multiplication is common, and the frozen parameter agrees with its actual original cellQ.",
    "On the full prime prefix range, the sum of absolute normalized Theta differences tends to zero in the nested order. The positive supporting cube follows from either actually admitted Member. Uniform in common changing marks of magnitude at most one.",
    "For each fixed mesh and epsilon one can choose T and then for each n >= T an N0(n) simultaneously for all targets above that threshold, depths 0..440, full fixed Programs, both roots, polarities and 401 atoms, with their fixed native coordinate ordering.",
    "The original deterministic emitted shape-word position coefficient and its frozenCarrier-guarded single additive receipt specialize the common mark bound. The latter threshold is common to every m and individual ell."
  ],
  "openScope": [
    "Summing over the additive-prime receiver ell, its cardinality, and the true aggregate congruence/rough sieve count and remainder.",
    "Comparing separately selected integer owners, winners, adopted histories or signed-action receiver bases; relative errors on arbitrary concentrated marked families.",
    "A single N0 uniform across all sufficiently fine n, or a geometric-to-arithmetic licence for the whole 430+11 realization and original H34."
